				{
					"id": 708150901,
					"content": "娃娃…風箏…風車…爸爸果然又送了這些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708150902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 708150902,
					"content": "唉，可惜了我搜集的那些禮物，沒法送到爸爸手上了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708150903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 708150903,
					"content": "我幫妳把禮物送過去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708150904
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 708150904,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}要幫我送過去？好吧…雖然{F#妳}{M#你}沒有「神之眼」，但{F#妳}{M#你}剛才對付那些魔物的樣子，好像還滿輕鬆的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708150905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 708150905,
					"content": "#也只能這樣了，那就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						708150906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
				},
				{
					"id": 708150906,
					"content": "#唉，要是…我也有{F#妳}{M#你}這樣的身手就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "小六"
